<title>USA: U.S. debt futures close pit trade narrowly mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures close pit trade narrowly mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 14 - U.S. debt futures closed pit trade narrowly mixed. June T-bonds traded inside Friday's ranges in extremely light trade due to nervousness about U.S. CPI on Tuesday. Sept Euros edged lower. Trade was more active in June Euros, traders said.</p>
